            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "EPR Properties (EPR): One-Off $56.9M Loss Challenges Dividend and Profitability Narratives",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "EPR Properties (EPR) reported revenue is expected to grow at just 2.5% per year, which falls well short of the 10.3% annual average for the US market. Net profit margins dropped to 22.2%, down from 26.8% last year, and reported earnings were hit by a one-off $56.9 million loss in the most recent twelve months. While EPR\u2019s five-year annual earnings growth rate sits at 46%, recent results turned negative and now run below that multi-year trend. This signals a pivot point for the business. See...",
